Lip model exclusion

The file KCD2_SoundFramework_lipmodel.bin (build/template/ in this repository,
and in every release) is NOT part of the Software and is NOT covered by the MIT
License above.

It holds model weights derived from Kingdom Come: Deliverance II game data,
which belongs to Warhorse Studios and PLAION. It is provided only for use with
Kingdom Come: Deliverance II through KCD2_SoundFramework, under the game's
end-user license agreement and Warhorse's modding guidelines. No other rights
are granted: do not redistribute it outside this mod, use it in other games or
products, or use it commercially.
